BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 357.55 Tm (Body: Quick checks the inspectors use to catch hidden wear, doctored chains and freshly changed oil before money) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 342.32 Tm (moves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.10 Tm (Items: Look at how far the front idler is pushed out, then jump on the rails and rock them; a seller who pumped the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.87 Tm (tracks up really tight may be hiding worn-out track links [C&C Equipment - Hif9qgd9EEI @ 00:02:25].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 296.65 Tm (A chain that looks like a piano string can mean someone cut a link out to take up internal wear, so count links against) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.42 Tm (OEM spec and confirm proper sag [Volvo Construction Equipment - North America - L3kAdkTSgI4 @ 00:06:35].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.20 Tm (If the seller changed the oil right before your sample, the lab can tell you it looks like a brand new sample, and 24 to 48) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.97 Tm (hour turnaround fits a used-machine purchase [EquipmentWorld - QYimn88ydQI @ 00:05:21].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.75 Tm (Reach in and feel the top of the bushing; a worn spot or flat edge up top means the pins and bushings have already been) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.52 Tm (turned [Jim Mack - YyZcRwETdeA @ 00:02:28].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.30 Tm (Section 3: Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.07 Tm (Inspectors split first on tooling and on how to turn raw readings into one sellable number. Clinton and Kevin at C&C) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.85 Tm (Equipment run an ITR America kit and inspection report, tell buyers a straight edge will do if they lack the fancy tools,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.62 Tm (and then sum every component reading: 3,200 equals fully worn, and their 1,010 meant 31 percent worn and 69 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.40 Tm (remaining on a 2010 Komatsu showing roughly 4,700 hours [Hif9qgd9EEI @ 00:11:05]. The Cat dealer workflow is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.17 Tm (instrument-heavy, calling for the UWI 5 ultrasonic tool plus calipers, depth gauge, tape measures, ruler and wire brush,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 99.95 Tm (about half an hour for a full measure-up, with ultrasonic carrier roller readings reserved for D8 through D11 while D7) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 84.72 Tm (and lower get calipers [fP5ysbGB2H0 @ 00:00:19]. Komatsu Australia front-loads the ultrasonic unit with model,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 69.50 Tm (serial number, service meter reading, inspection date and sealed or lubricated track type, and only trusts a reading once) Tj ET
