BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.00 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 413.77 Tm (The cheapest traps on a used tracked machine are the ones a seller builds on purpose. C&C Equipment warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 398.55 Tm (someone may pump the tracks up really tight to hide a worn-out track link, so they jump on the rails and rock them) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 383.32 Tm (back and forth, and check whether the front idler is pushed way out [Hif9qgd9EEI @ 00:02:25]. Volvo's inspector has) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 368.10 Tm (seen owners cut a link out of a stretched chain and tighten it back up; the tell is a chain that looks like a piano string, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 352.87 Tm (count links against factory spec and confirm proper sag, because an over-tight chain puts extra wear on every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 337.65 Tm (consumable in the undercarriage [L3kAdkTSgI4 @ 00:06:20]. The same inspector flags idlers welded back up without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 322.42 Tm (changing the bearings inside, which shows as a wobble that takes a second person to spot, pins that walked out and got) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 307.20 Tm (welded in from the inside, and track adjusters welded solid so they can no longer extend, which a grease gun tightening) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.97 Tm (test exposes [L3kAdkTSgI4 @ 00:07:20]. At auctions an L can show up on the side of a machine, so count for the nine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 276.75 Tm (bottom rollers of a long undercarriage. Jim Mack adds that a flat edge felt on top of a bushing means the pins and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 261.52 Tm (bushings have already been turned once [YyZcRwETdeA @ 00:02:10].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 246.30 Tm (The economics checks are blunt. Volvo puts the undercarriage among the single most expensive components to replace) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.07 Tm (on a used track hoe, from about 12,000 to upwards of 70,000 dollars depending on machine size, and calls it the item) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.85 Tm (most often undervalued and missed [L3kAdkTSgI4 @ 00:00:01]. C&C Equipment's hardest warning is the 50 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.62 Tm (cliff: once a machine measures around 40 or 50 percent worn, the wear has cut through the hardened material into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.40 Tm (softer metal and goes way quicker, so 6,000 hours at 50 percent does not buy another 6,000 hours, and their own shop) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.17 Tm (usually replaces undercarriage that arrives at that level [Hif9qgd9EEI @ 00:11:54]. Hunter Valley Tracks builds its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.95 Tm (maintenance plan around that curve, targeting pin and bush turns at 7,000 hours or 60 percent rail wear and using) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 139.72 Tm (mid-life readings to decide when to rotate rollers and idlers and when to re-lug shoes [1B6uxG5WNzQ @ 00:01:12].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 124.50 Tm (On the fluid side, Bryan of Equipment World asked whether an oil sample could clear a 60 grand used purchase in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 109.27 Tm (time; Shelly answered that turnaround typically runs 24 to 48 hours, and that an engine sample generally costs under 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 94.05 Tm (dollars through a branded volume program and under 20 on the high side, with prepaid kits more cost effective) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 78.82 Tm ([QYimn88ydQI @ 00:05:07].) Tj ET
