BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (also pricing the empty leg. On the 777 move, the 13-axle had to deadhead about 1,200 miles to Gillette, Wyoming,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (because little big freight comes out of Seattle, and a carrier doing the job right bakes that leg into the number. That puts) Tj ET
