BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (breaks pickup promises. The Washington permit took three weeks, and 500,000-pound pieces on 30-axle trailers can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (wait four months for route surveys [qHs0sXdzamw @ 00:15:56]. Trinity Logistics puts permit fees anywhere from $15) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (to over $70 depending on the state and size. Some states charge application fees that drop or disappear once a frequent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (mover sets up an account, and states offer one-time, multiple-move, and annual permits for similar hauls) Tj ET
