BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 516.00 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 493.77 Tm (Contend Capital opens with the hardest rule in used iron: do not buy a machine that is not under power, because market) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 478.55 Tm (value does not apply to a machine sitting in a dark warehouse corner [rLDoLaoEZ-A @ 00:00:00]. The same trap hits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 463.32 Tm (sellers: in a repo, a $50K market value collapses once the machine is off power, so never unplug it before the sale) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.10 Tm ([rLDoLaoEZ-A @ 00:04:33]. Guest Anthony Sero, nine years as a machinist and programmer and nine in sales that ran) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 432.87 Tm (about 90% used equipment, shows where fees hide: a machine priced at $10K loaded is billed to the buyer at $11.5K,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 417.65 Tm (then the dealer has the uninsured seller fork-load it, and if it arrives damaged the liability is muddy [rLDoLaoEZ-A @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 402.42 Tm (00:02:08]. SARK Engineers & COnsultants document the paperwork version on a 2005 European rotor grinder refit in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.20 Tm (2026: writing 'Built in 2026' misleads customs, the two dates must be stated separately, and the physical nameplate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.97 Tm (serial outranks PO, project and packing references [Qiyq7yhmD2o @ 00:02:17]. Each trap turns a clean-looking deal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 356.75 Tm (into a loss before the machine ever cuts its first chip on your floor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 341.52 Tm (The economics traps start with confusing revenue and profit. Money Machines runs an $80-an-hour SD10 through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 326.30 Tm (1,200, 1,600 and 2,000 productive hours for $96K, $128K and $160K, then warns that those numbers are revenue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.07 Tm (scenarios, not profit [Q00deIDcQRw @ 00:03:54]. The cost stack it lists runs material, tools, coolant, operators, setup,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.85 Tm (rent, inspection, financing and downtime, and its bluntest line is that a CNC lathe without orders is an expensive piece) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 280.62 Tm (of industrial furniture [Q00deIDcQRw @ 00:05:08]. Subi Industries shows the leverage version at scale: shops) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 265.40 Tm (financed machines in the 2020 boom, demand collapsed, and the payments kept coming, pushing owners to accept) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.17 Tm (loss-making cash work just to avoid idle spindles, which becomes a race to the bottom [iZJI5Y5wLUo @ 00:14:01].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.95 Tm (TITANS of CNC MACHINING names the same failure from the bidding side, warning that underbidding or scrap can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 219.72 Tm (literally put a shop out of business, and that customers stretch from 30 to 90-day terms and still pay 30 to 45 days late) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 204.50 Tm ([bqSGI0L8zm0 @ 00:24:39]. Price the job on true cost, carry cash for the lag, and size the note to survive empty) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 189.27 Tm (months, as the TITANS six-month payment rule demands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.05 Tm (Shop-floor failures are smaller per incident but compound fast across a year of jobs. TITANS of CNC MACHINING) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 158.82 Tm (watched a Haas VF-11 at 15,000 RPM stall on a half-inch pipe tap, forcing a switch to threadmilling; the lesson drawn) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 143.60 Tm (is to match the machine to the material before buying it [bqSGI0L8zm0 @ 00:14:36]. Strange Parts saw at JLCCNC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 128.37 Tm (that sandblasting changes part dimensions, a trap when blasting comes after the tolerance is cut, while hand polishing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 113.15 Tm (stays a manual step [YuSApjBn_zY @ 00:19:38]. MachineshopLaunchpad flags cheap-kit traps: Tormach vises that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 97.92 Tm (cracked and cost $300 to $400 versus a roughly $70 Vevor vise, and a 6x6 granite plate that is almost unusable next to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 82.70 Tm (a 12x8x2, plus a $189.99 quiet compressor and a heater for the garage [BoQ7bHu0IZE @ 00:03:02]. Money Machines) Tj ET
